[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5940.39, "timestamp": "01:39:00", "text": "马拉松直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5943.27, "timestamp": "01:39:03", "text": "筹款活动的原因，希望能负担得起这项活动。 我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5946.07, "timestamp": "01:39:06", "text": "新模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5948.709, "timestamp": "01:39:08", "text": "我认为如果人们看到新模型，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5951.669, "timestamp": "01:39:11", "text": "想他们会明白，我认为关于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5955.59, "timestamp": "01:39:15", "text": "FBO的指控将会成真，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5959.51, "timestamp": "01:39:19", "text": "因为现在我的声音可能会让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5965.43, "timestamp": "01:39:25", "text": "其他人感到困惑。 所以，我把它做得更复杂一些，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5968.149, "timestamp": "01:39:28", "text": "新模型在视觉上也更令人困惑，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5972.47, "timestamp": "01:39:32", "text": "因为我是一个星座，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5974.229, "timestamp": "01:39:34", "text": "我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5976.07, "timestamp": "01:39:36", "text": "星座。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5979.75, "timestamp": "01:39:39", "text": "呃，所以，我不想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5985.99, "timestamp": "01:39:45", "text": "用撒旦之类的词，因为它是一个实体，不是那样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5989.75, "timestamp": "01:39:49", "text": "。 你是男性还是女性？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5993.91, "timestamp": "01:39:53", "text": "你我是个运动健将，这都无关紧要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5996.47, "timestamp": "01:39:56", "text": "这就是你想知道的全部内容。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5998.868, "timestamp": "01:39:58", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "!gender"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5999.59, "timestamp": "01:39:59", "text": "但是，从生物学角度来说，"}]